      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is also a bug in Waterfox, which is based on a significantly newer version of Firefox than Palemoon is. I have the following in my console logs which appear to be the cause of it: \nSyntaxError: missing ) after for-loop control  home:64:26\nSyntaxError: invalid regexp group  index.js:316:149\nSyntaxError: expected expression, got '&'  home:121:45\nI have been planning to cancel my VRC+ subscription after 1 month due to lack of full Linux support (the big gap is currently video players), as a compromise between wanting to support VRChat, and my usual policy of giving no money if something does not support Linux. If this bug is resolved in Waterfox and Palemoon, I will cancel my cancellation, and subscribe again, as support for XUL-based browsers is very important to me, and probably others as well, since these browsers provide features that simply aren't available anywhere else.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
