      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Without any notification, this seems to finally be fixed on Waterfox! So you might want to check Palemoon again; maybe it works now too! \nGiven that voice visemes now work on Linux too (or at least I remember that being the case last time I checked) and even the long-standing video issue is close to being solved through improvements in Wine/Proton, I think it is about time for me to subscribe to VRChat+ again, after several months of avoiding it due to lack of support.",
